Taking expectations and summing over \(t\), we get
\[
    \mathbb{E}\left[\sum_{t=1}^T r^H_t(a)\right]
    \leq
    \mathbb{E}\left[\sum_{t=1}^T r^H_t(b(a))\right]
    +
    \frac{T}{K}
